ler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑がりだと思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"罰ゲームで飲んだ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センブリ茶ってどんな味だった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガチで激まず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦いを通り越した苦さ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飲んだ後も舌に残ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ち悪くなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い子は飲まないでね☆←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「１６人のプリンシパル」で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番のお気に入りのシーンって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこだった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一幕の最後AKB48さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「蕾たち」を歌ったシーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鏡見て表情を作る練習は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したりするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"するよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみには緑のおかずとみたらし団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーんしてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日載せ忘れたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニットの形はこんな感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいんだよね、まったくだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってさ、ちまが近くにいるときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が他のメンバーとしゃべってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まりか～」って言ってきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとすねるんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外でしょ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかはひなちまのこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまってるぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日も頑張りまりかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-59616":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も本当にありがとうございました。\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  あっという間すぎて\n  時の流れは恐ろしいものだとも感じておりますが\n  とにかく新発見の多い年だったと思います。\n  \n  \n  \n  皆さんも新しい日常に苦労する事も\n  まだまだ沢山あるとは思いますが\n  お互いこれからも乗り越えていきましょう。\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  2021年も\n  人に感謝して\n  更なる成長の為に努力して\n  沢山笑える年にしたいです。\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  体調にはお気をつけて。\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  そして、レコ大ありがとうございました。\n  凄くいい経験をさせて頂きました。\n  自分って凄いものを見てきたんだなとか\n  深い経験をしているんだと\n  より、噛み締められた1日でした。\n  \n  小さい頃からテレビが好きで音楽が好きな家に\n  育ったので\n  沢山知っている歌があり\n  誰よりも歌番組を楽しんでいます。\n  \n  \n  何でも歌えて踊れすぎて\n  自分のジャンルの広さにふとびっくりします。\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  本当にありがとうございました。\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  そして、紅白ありがとうございました。\n  当たり前は当たり前でないと感じられる\n  素敵な瞬間でした。\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  2021年も仲良くしてください。✨\n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFSAHE4REP28JRMHA5WK7F8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  私にしては短めのブログですが\n  良いお年を、を言いたくて書きました。\n  \n  \n  良いお年をー。✨"}],"source":"archive"}}